* 1 (Post Beta 53.0)
Effects:
* [[File:Froggit Trio (Beta 53.0).png|thumb]]Summon 3 Froggits if the enemy has more monsters than you. (Post Beta 6.6)
* Summon 3 Froggits if the enemy has at least 1 monster. (Post Beta 12.1)
* Summon 3 Froggits if the enemy has more monsters than you. (Post Beta 21.0)
* Add 3 Froggits with Haste to your hand. (Post Beta 42.0)
* Summon 2 Froggits with Haste. Delay: If both are dead, add 1 to your hand with -1 cost. (Current)
Rarity: White (Common)

